occt-import-js and Open CASCADE Technology  --
  project/com.inductiveautomation.webdev/resources/lib/occt-import-js.js
  project/com.inductiveautomation.webdev/resources/lib/occt-import-js.wasm
================================================================================

The CAD page reads STEP files with occt-import-js 0.0.23 by Viktor Kovacs
<https://github.com/kovacsv/occt-import-js>, the emscripten build of the
STEP/IGES/BREP import functions of Open CASCADE Technology (OCCT)
<https://dev.opencascade.org>, (c) OPEN CASCADE SAS.

Both files are the unmodified `dist/` files of the npm package
occt-import-js@0.0.23. The .wasm statically includes OCCT at commit
d2abb6d844231cb8f29be6894440874a4700e4a5 of
https://git.dev.opencascade.org/repos/occt.git (the `occt` submodule of
occt-import-js at tag 0.0.23).

This product makes use of facilities provided by the Open CASCADE Technology
software.

occt-import-js is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1. OCCT is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License,
version 2.1, with the Open CASCADE exception version 1.0. The licence texts
are shipped beside the binaries, as published upstream:

  project/com.inductiveautomation.webdev/resources/lib/license.occt-import-js.txt
  project/com.inductiveautomation.webdev/resources/lib/license.occt.txt

Corresponding source:
  occt-import-js  https://github.com/kovacsv/occt-import-js/tree/0.0.23
                  (also in the npm tarball occt-import-js-0.0.23.tgz)
  OCCT            https://git.dev.opencascade.org/repos/occt.git
                  commit d2abb6d844231cb8f29be6894440874a4700e4a5

The library is loaded by the CAD page at runtime as a separate file. To use a
modified build, replace those two files with your own build of
occt-import-js; nothing else in this project depends on their contents.

